          "requirement": "Exercise parse_ex number continuation across calls on one tokener, including reconstruction of a saved exponent and rejection of a misplaced following minus sign.",
          "target_route": "Create a tokener; call parse_ex with an initial partial number, then call parse_ex again on that same tokener with the continuation.",
